<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>系统辨识包 on Alray Doc</title><link>https://alrayqiu.github.io/toolkits/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%BE%A8%E8%AF%86/</link><description>Recent content in 系统辨识包 on Alray Doc</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://alrayqiu.github.io/toolkits/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%BE%A8%E8%AF%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>云台辨识：全方向Yaw</title><link>https://alrayqiu.github.io/toolkits/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%BE%A8%E8%AF%86/gimbal_yaw/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://alrayqiu.github.io/toolkits/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%BE%A8%E8%AF%86/gimbal_yaw/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="描述"&gt;描述&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$\dot\theta$ 是云台yaw轴速度&lt;br&gt;
$\mu$ 是控制力矩或电流&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;云台建模为
&lt;/p&gt;
$$\ddot\theta = -\frac{B}{J} \dot\theta + \frac{1}{J}\mu$$&lt;p&gt;对应传递函数为
&lt;/p&gt;
$$\dot\theta(s) = \frac{b \mu(s)}{s - a}$$&lt;p&gt;辨识参数 $a \ b$&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;初始化后会在~/alliance/identify 中创建一个文件夹，名字为当前时间戳，如果没有路径则会报错&lt;/p&gt;
